in next to both team-id columns -- \code{team_id} gains \code{team_name},
\code{team_abbreviation}, ..., and \code{leader_team_id} gains \code{leader_team_name},
\code{leader_team_abbreviation}, .... A catalog failure degrades to \code{NA}
rather than erroring the wrapper. Set \code{team_detail = FALSE} to skip the
catalog fetch and the join.
